The key to piloting Yuna, Hope of Spira is understanding its core engine: Yuna protects enchantment creatures with trample, lifelink, and ward 2, and reanimates any enchantment from your graveyard to the battlefield every end step, establishing unbreakable board presence and lifegain.
This is a Bracket 3 build running three Game Changers: Smothering Tithe, Teferi's Protection, Enlightened Tutor. It contains zero mass land denial and focuses on high-synergy board development, interactive answers, and an inevitable endgame clock.

# Commander and Core Synergy
Yuna, Hope of Spira :: primary commander driving the deck's core strategy
Sythis, Harvest's Hand :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Sanctum Weaver :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Sterling Grove :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Destiny Spinner :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Eidolon of Blossoms :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage

